  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: n=768, score=1.505008\n\n=== Phase 1: Subgradient Warm-up ===\n  Time: 90s\n\n=== Phase 2: LP-Frank-Wolfe (n=768) ===\n  Time: 450s\n\n=== Phase 3: Mirror Descent ===\n  Time: 147s\n    MD iter 100: obj=0.0009798224, eps=0.001811\n    MD iter 300: obj=0.0009798222, eps=0.001483\n  NEW BEST [mirror]: 1.505007 (n=768)\n\n=== Phase 4: LP-FW Round 2 ===\n  Time: 194s\n\n=== Phase 5: Multi-length ===\n  LP-FW n=1024: t=90s\n  LP-FW n=512: t=90s\n  LP-FW n=1280: t=84s\n\n=== Phase 6: Perturbed LP-FW ===\n  Variant 0: t=80s\n  Variant 1: t=80s\n  Variant 2: t=80s\n  Variant 3: t=80s\n\n=== Phase 7: Coordinate Descent ===\n  Time: 45s\n\n=== Phase 8: Final Squeeze ===\n  Time: 30s\n\nFINAL SCORE: 1.505007 (n=768)",
